---
// Acceso compacto al bot de Discord (antes era el protagonista del hero de comunidad).
---

<section class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 py-10">
  <a
    href="/bot"
    class="group flex items-center gap-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto px-5 py-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] hover:border-purple-400/50 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-purple-400"
  >
    <img
      src="https://cdn.discordapp.com/app-icons/1503802588510818496/841251b24d5db8e9ba3a19c87e894442.png?size=64"
      alt=""
      width="44"
      height="44"
      loading="lazy"
      class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full border border-purple-400/40"
    />
    <span class="flex-1 min-w-0">
      <span class="block font-bold text-white">El bot de Discord de TeamLag</span>
      <span class="block text-sm text-gray-400 truncate">Comandos, música y estadísticas del servidor.</span>
    </span>
    <span class="text-sm text-purple-300 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">Conocerlo</span>
  </a>
</section>
